WEBVTT

01:24.800 --> 01:27.280
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:34.240 --> 01:35.240
Duanwu!

01:35.320 --> 01:37.440
Duanwu!

01:37.520 --> 01:39.600
-Duanwu!
-Duanwu!

01:39.680 --> 01:42.800
-Duanwu!
-Duanwu!

01:42.880 --> 01:44.480
-Duanwu!
-Duanwu!

01:44.560 --> 01:45.440
-Duanwu!
-Duanwu!

01:45.520 --> 01:46.840
Duanwu!

01:47.520 --> 01:48.720
Have you seen a girl

01:48.800 --> 01:50.240
this tall with thin eyebrows

01:50.320 --> 01:51.280
and big eyes?

01:51.360 --> 01:52.720
No, I haven't.

01:52.800 --> 01:53.880
-Duanwu!
-Have you seen a girl this tall?

01:53.960 --> 01:54.800
She's about yea tall.

01:54.880 --> 01:56.200
-Duanwu!
-No, I haven't.

01:56.280 --> 02:00.200
-Duanwu!
-Duanwu!

02:00.280 --> 02:01.600
Duanwu!

02:01.680 --> 02:02.720
Duanwu!

02:04.320 --> 02:05.680
Duanwu!

02:06.280 --> 02:07.120
Go.

02:07.200 --> 02:09.320
-Duanwu!
-Duanwu!

02:10.320 --> 02:11.920
-Duanwu!
-Duanwu!

02:12.000 --> 02:13.160
Let's go there.

02:13.240 --> 02:14.920
-Duanwu!
-Duanwu!

02:15.440 --> 02:16.440
Leader!

03:00.720 --> 03:01.960
Hurry!

03:14.560 --> 03:15.440
Did you frisk her?

03:15.520 --> 03:17.400
Yes. And I searched her room.

03:18.320 --> 03:20.280
It's a small place.

03:20.360 --> 03:22.520
Where did she hide
the blood-stained pearl?

03:23.200 --> 03:24.280
Let's report first.

03:24.360 --> 03:25.960
We'll come back and torture her

03:26.960 --> 03:29.200
-into confessing.
-Go.

03:52.440 --> 03:53.600
The map of the Gulistan treasure

03:54.640 --> 03:56.560
is in the blood-stained pearl.

03:57.200 --> 03:58.880
The Black Dragon Bandits

03:59.600 --> 04:01.480
wanted the Gulistan treasure.

04:22.480 --> 04:24.680
The blood-stained pearl
is not on that girl.

04:27.520 --> 04:29.920
Then, it's on that man.

04:30.000 --> 04:32.040
Get something from that girl.

04:34.520 --> 04:37.120
Send this letter and the thing to him.

04:38.760 --> 04:39.600
Yes.

04:58.160 --> 04:59.200
You are awake.

04:59.840 --> 05:02.280
Get something from her.
Send the letter and the thing to him.

05:09.400 --> 05:10.240
What is it?

05:11.120 --> 05:12.680
Let go.

05:12.760 --> 05:13.840
Let go.

05:17.760 --> 05:18.680
That's it.

05:25.760 --> 05:29.000
Yan Zijing, will you take the risk?

05:33.000 --> 05:34.080
Did you find her?

05:34.160 --> 05:35.880
I looked for her
all over the Langhuan Dockyard. No.

05:37.040 --> 05:38.240
-Keep looking.
-Okay.

05:38.320 --> 05:39.440
Master.

05:41.240 --> 05:42.480
Master, we found this outside.

05:42.560 --> 05:43.880
I didn't see anyone.

05:49.920 --> 05:53.760
TRADE THE BLOOD-STAINED PEARL WITH DUANWU

05:58.800 --> 06:00.520
Duanwu was taken away.

06:00.600 --> 06:01.560
It's the Black Dragon Bandits.

06:07.160 --> 06:10.080
Maybe I'll make a purple star bracelet.

06:10.680 --> 06:11.920
I'll wear it.

06:12.520 --> 06:14.880
Let's go to Lake Zijing
to see the purple star. What do you say?

06:16.200 --> 06:17.240
Okay.

06:20.680 --> 06:21.720
Duanwu.

06:22.760 --> 06:24.280
Did you want to tell me

06:24.880 --> 06:26.320
you were at the Lake Zijing?

06:46.200 --> 06:48.960
I want some water.

06:49.040 --> 06:50.600
If you can't hand over
the blood-stained pearl on time,

06:50.680 --> 06:52.680
you'll die.
Don't think about drinking water.

06:52.760 --> 06:54.920
The blood-stained pearl is not with him.

06:55.000 --> 06:56.240
He can't give it to you.

06:56.320 --> 06:57.360
Um…

06:58.680 --> 07:00.840
Where is the blood-stained pearl?

07:03.440 --> 07:04.640
Give me water.

07:05.960 --> 07:07.000
Give me water.

07:12.200 --> 07:14.720
Tell me where the blood-stained pearl is

07:14.800 --> 07:17.120
and I'll give you water.

07:27.840 --> 07:29.480
Lake Zijing.

07:31.080 --> 07:32.680
The blood-stained pearl
is at the Lake Zijing.

07:33.840 --> 07:34.680
Go.

07:34.760 --> 07:35.880
Water.

07:35.960 --> 07:37.520
Give me water.

07:46.040 --> 07:47.680
Go.

07:48.760 --> 07:49.880
Go.

08:22.000 --> 08:23.240
It's not here.

08:25.880 --> 08:28.200
We didn't find it.

08:28.280 --> 08:29.960
She lied to us.
Let's go back and torture her.

08:30.040 --> 08:31.320
Go.

08:32.400 --> 08:33.640
Go!

08:35.400 --> 08:36.400
Go.

09:16.120 --> 09:19.560
I'll ask you one last time.
Where is the blood-stained pearl?

09:26.440 --> 09:27.480
Lake Zijing.

09:28.680 --> 09:29.920
I left it there.

10:05.560 --> 10:06.520
Duanwu.

10:07.120 --> 10:09.160
Duanwu. Duanwu.

10:09.240 --> 10:10.480
Duanwu.

10:11.200 --> 10:12.360
Duanwu, wake up.

10:13.200 --> 10:14.280
I'm Yan Zijing.

10:15.040 --> 10:16.240
Duanwu.

10:18.840 --> 10:21.440
It's me. It's okay.

10:21.520 --> 10:22.760
I'm here.

10:29.560 --> 10:31.560
I'm here. It's okay.

10:41.280 --> 10:42.120
Kang Ju.

13:13.920 --> 13:15.040
I'm sorry.

13:18.960 --> 13:20.080
It's all my fault.

14:00.840 --> 14:02.000
Something went wrong.

14:02.560 --> 14:04.560
Something happened to the witch doctor.

14:21.040 --> 14:22.080
He's dead.

14:34.200 --> 14:35.440
It's the Black Dragon Bandits' dart.

14:37.000 --> 14:38.800
They want you dead.

14:39.680 --> 14:42.120
The witch doctor is the only one
who can save you.

14:45.040 --> 14:45.920
Find the cure.

14:46.880 --> 14:49.600
Search for medicine.
What medicine is here?

14:53.680 --> 14:55.320
Search for medicine!

14:56.680 --> 14:57.760
Take a look over there!

15:01.280 --> 15:02.240
There.

15:02.920 --> 15:03.960
Search.

15:04.840 --> 15:06.360
Search!

15:12.280 --> 15:13.760
Supervisor Kang.

15:13.840 --> 15:15.920
All the herbs were taken away.

15:51.520 --> 15:53.320
Fortune makes a fool of me.

15:54.400 --> 15:58.280
Back then, I had nothing.
I was not afraid of death.

15:59.040 --> 16:00.080
Now,

16:01.000 --> 16:03.520
I have her in this world,

16:03.600 --> 16:05.040
but death will separate us.

16:06.680 --> 16:07.960
It's ridiculous.

16:14.360 --> 16:17.240
I'll protect you. I mean it.

16:20.440 --> 16:21.680
Okay.

16:38.720 --> 16:40.800
Do you really believe that
there will be a purple star in the sky?

16:40.880 --> 16:44.320
If two people see the purple star,
they will stay together forever.

16:44.400 --> 16:45.880
That's a lie.

16:45.960 --> 16:48.320
I didn't believe it before, but now,

16:51.240 --> 16:52.520
I'm willing to believe it.

18:04.120 --> 18:05.160
Duanwu.

18:09.960 --> 18:11.320
You're awake.

18:15.000 --> 18:15.840
How do you feel?

18:18.800 --> 18:19.920
Do you feel uncomfortable?

18:38.360 --> 18:39.480
How do you feel?

18:39.560 --> 18:40.680
Are you all right?

18:44.920 --> 18:46.280
Did you drink?

18:47.600 --> 18:48.560
I drank a little.

18:50.080 --> 18:51.400
What's wrong?

18:53.160 --> 18:55.880
Nothing. I'm worried about you.

18:58.080 --> 19:00.360
It was my fault.

19:01.720 --> 19:02.800
I'm sorry.

19:05.960 --> 19:07.520
It was not your fault.

19:09.400 --> 19:10.680
I was too careless.

19:12.280 --> 19:13.560
But I knew

19:15.040 --> 19:16.560
you could find me.

19:17.560 --> 19:19.600
After this time,

19:21.160 --> 19:22.440
I realized how important you are to me.

19:24.240 --> 19:25.880
I was anxious

19:25.960 --> 19:27.400
when I found out you were kidnapped.

19:27.480 --> 19:29.240
My heart broke

19:30.240 --> 19:31.600
when I saw you in the broken house,

19:32.120 --> 19:33.400
not knowing
whether you were alive or dead.

19:34.120 --> 19:35.920
From now on,

19:37.680 --> 19:40.080
I won't let you get hurt again.

19:51.200 --> 19:53.280
Before,

19:54.800 --> 19:56.200
I didn't have any worries in this world.

19:58.880 --> 20:00.280
But I have you now.

20:02.800 --> 20:04.160
You are the meaning of my life.

20:06.280 --> 20:07.640
Don't worry.

20:09.280 --> 20:10.520
I won't let you

20:11.360 --> 20:13.000
get hurt again.

20:14.880 --> 20:16.320
I was afraid.

20:20.480 --> 20:22.160
I was afraid I would never see you again.

20:27.920 --> 20:29.040
But I knew…

20:32.680 --> 20:34.200
you wouldn't leave me alone.

20:36.520 --> 20:37.680
Duanwu.

20:42.760 --> 20:44.240
Do you want to see the purple star

20:44.880 --> 20:45.960
and the two stars shine bright?

20:52.720 --> 20:53.880
I'll show you.

21:10.120 --> 21:11.240
Mr. Zhang.

21:11.320 --> 21:12.400
Lady Shiqi.

21:13.080 --> 21:14.840
I have a favor to ask you.

21:14.920 --> 21:16.520
I want to go with you to find Duanwu.

21:16.600 --> 21:18.120
Lady Shiqi.

21:18.200 --> 21:19.880
We're going to the desert
to suppress bandits.

21:19.960 --> 21:20.840
It's dangerous.

21:20.920 --> 21:22.760
I promised Duanwu

21:22.840 --> 21:24.200
to heal your hands.

21:25.120 --> 21:27.520
Just wait for news from us in the camp.

21:27.600 --> 21:28.560
Mr. Zhang.

21:28.640 --> 21:30.160
My hands are about to be healed.

21:30.240 --> 21:32.160
I won't drag you down.

21:32.240 --> 21:34.600
I'm worried about Duanwu.

21:34.680 --> 21:35.600
Mr. Zhang, please let me go with you.

21:35.680 --> 21:38.480
We can't imagine
the dangers of the journey.

21:39.800 --> 21:41.680
Besides, your hands haven't healed yet.

21:41.760 --> 21:43.840
And there's a lot of inconvenience
on the front line.

21:43.920 --> 21:45.920
If something happens to you,
I can't explain it to Duanwu.

21:46.000 --> 21:47.720
I'm not afraid of danger.

21:47.800 --> 21:49.800
Please, Mr. Zhang.
Please take me with you.

21:52.840 --> 21:54.520
I'm afraid I have to refuse you.

21:56.320 --> 21:57.440
Mr. Zhang.

21:58.680 --> 22:01.240
Please bring Duanwu back safely.

22:03.000 --> 22:04.160
You must come back safely.

22:10.840 --> 22:12.480
-Let's go!
-General!

22:14.760 --> 22:15.880
General Pei.

22:15.960 --> 22:18.720
General Ling said
he would arrive at our camp tomorrow.

22:18.800 --> 22:21.000
General, please wait here for him.

22:22.320 --> 22:25.440
I'm going to battle. But General Ling…

22:25.520 --> 22:27.080
It's a big deal.

22:27.160 --> 22:28.960
I knew I couldn't stop you.

22:29.040 --> 22:30.360
So, I reported to General Ling.

22:35.000 --> 22:36.280
General.

22:36.360 --> 22:38.320
It's about the entire Pei's army.

22:38.400 --> 22:39.920
Please think twice.

22:41.120 --> 22:42.280
General Ling commanded you

22:42.360 --> 22:45.360
not to leave the camp.

22:54.040 --> 22:56.480
You and Yan Zijing's plan is dangerous.

22:57.360 --> 22:58.920
I'm afraid you will be in danger.

22:59.560 --> 23:02.080
It is dangerous, but we have to do it.

23:02.160 --> 23:04.560
If I can't get there on the agreed date,

23:04.640 --> 23:06.120
Duanwu, Yan Zijing,

23:06.200 --> 23:08.880
and the trading convoy will be in danger.

23:12.480 --> 23:13.640
No.

23:14.600 --> 23:15.840
I have to go to Shijie.

23:20.240 --> 23:22.720
Shijie. I know you can't disobey orders.

23:23.480 --> 23:25.000
Besides, the Pei's army's fate

23:25.080 --> 23:26.520
is in your hands.

23:26.600 --> 23:28.840
I don't want to give you a hard time.

23:30.080 --> 23:32.120
I have a commitment with Yan Zijing.

23:32.200 --> 23:34.360
Even if it's just me and Du Ming,

23:35.160 --> 23:37.800
we'll arrive at the Piti Spring
on the day of the full moon.

23:40.280 --> 23:42.600
Shijie, see you.

23:43.200 --> 23:44.200
Jinran.

23:44.880 --> 23:46.960
I'll give you my personal guards.

23:47.040 --> 23:49.160
They are elites
who have been through a lot of battles.

23:50.400 --> 23:51.280
Thank you, Shijie.

23:53.760 --> 23:55.040
I'm sorry

23:56.040 --> 23:57.080
for you this time.

23:57.760 --> 23:59.560
I understand
that you cannot disobey orders.

24:02.920 --> 24:03.960
See you.

24:04.880 --> 24:05.840
Please.

24:59.960 --> 25:01.040
Is there

25:01.840 --> 25:03.880
really no purple star?

25:04.640 --> 25:06.480
If there really is no purple star,

25:06.560 --> 25:08.560
some people have been deceived.

25:09.400 --> 25:11.080
I told you it was a lie.

25:14.280 --> 25:16.040
Maybe it will come out later.

25:17.520 --> 25:18.600
Let's wait a little longer.

25:21.240 --> 25:22.400
Then…

25:24.160 --> 25:25.440
Where do we go next?

25:26.280 --> 25:28.920
I mean, where are we going

25:29.000 --> 25:29.960
after we settle
the Black Dragon Bandits' matter?

25:36.280 --> 25:37.520
After that…

25:41.560 --> 25:43.000
Let me think about it.

25:46.480 --> 25:47.400
We'll go to Yangzhou.

25:52.200 --> 25:53.480
Yangzhou?

25:55.240 --> 25:56.520
Yangzhou is your hometown.

25:56.600 --> 25:58.480
You told me

25:58.560 --> 26:01.080
it was where my parents fell in love.

26:26.000 --> 26:27.320
When the two stars shine bright,

26:28.640 --> 26:30.480
we can get what we want

26:32.640 --> 26:33.840
and stay together

26:35.000 --> 26:36.440
forever.

26:41.360 --> 26:43.640
I hope we can see the purple star today.

26:45.200 --> 26:48.960
If we see the purple star,
we can get what we want.

27:44.280 --> 27:45.800
You're important to me.

27:46.560 --> 27:48.040
I can't bear to leave you.

27:49.120 --> 27:50.960
But I must

27:51.040 --> 27:52.480
avenge the Yan family.

27:53.480 --> 27:55.000
If I don't get my revenge,

27:56.000 --> 27:58.240
I'll disappoint my ancestors.

28:00.960 --> 28:02.600
Are you willing to leave?

28:03.320 --> 28:04.560
She'll hate you.

28:23.640 --> 28:25.280
Li Kui killed countless people.

28:25.800 --> 28:27.600
This trip is dangerous.

28:28.440 --> 28:30.640
I can only leave you
at the Langhuan Dockyard.

28:31.680 --> 28:34.480
If we are lucky, I will see you again

28:35.200 --> 28:36.520
and apologize to you.

28:37.800 --> 28:38.920
If we are not lucky,

28:39.440 --> 28:40.600
I will die.

28:41.120 --> 28:43.880
I wish you all the best.

28:58.000 --> 28:59.200
There's an ambush.

30:06.840 --> 30:09.560
Sogdians. The Black Dragon Bandits.

30:11.280 --> 30:12.280
Kang Ju.

30:12.360 --> 30:14.400
There are people from the Black Dragon
Bandits in our trading convoy.

30:19.640 --> 30:21.440
They dressed up as our guards.

30:48.400 --> 30:49.400
Master!

30:58.320 --> 30:59.160
Go!

31:04.000 --> 31:05.040
-Go!
-Hurry.

31:06.720 --> 31:07.880
Be careful!

31:08.720 --> 31:11.440
-Hurry.
-Hide with Shrimp. Go!

31:11.520 --> 31:13.280
-You…
-Just go!

31:15.560 --> 31:16.840
Go!

31:19.160 --> 31:22.040
Don't come any closer!

31:42.080 --> 31:43.800
I'll fight you!

31:46.360 --> 31:49.080
Cao Da!

32:11.320 --> 32:12.560
Cao Da!

33:04.760 --> 33:06.080
Loud!

33:06.160 --> 33:07.840
Loud!

33:07.920 --> 33:09.080
Loud!

33:09.160 --> 33:10.640
Run!

34:33.760 --> 34:35.800
Kill! Kill them all!

34:56.840 --> 34:57.880
Li Kui.

35:06.880 --> 35:08.200
You are a guard of the trading convoy.

35:15.840 --> 35:17.360
Shrimp, run!

35:17.440 --> 35:20.480
Run!

35:20.560 --> 35:23.200
A trading convoy guard wants to kill us!

35:23.280 --> 35:26.080
Duanwu, run!

35:32.720 --> 35:34.600
Duanwu, run!

35:35.600 --> 35:36.960
A trading convoy guard wants to kill us!

35:37.760 --> 35:38.800
Shrimp.

35:41.440 --> 35:42.880
-Duanwu!
-Shrimp!

35:52.920 --> 35:54.680
Shrimp!

35:58.280 --> 35:59.120
Shrimp.

36:00.400 --> 36:01.800
Shrimp.

36:01.880 --> 36:03.280
Shrimp.

36:03.880 --> 36:04.880
Shrimp.

36:04.960 --> 36:06.280
Don't be scared.

36:07.040 --> 36:08.520
I'll take you away.

36:11.840 --> 36:12.760
Shrimp.

36:13.480 --> 36:14.600
Shrimp.

36:44.440 --> 36:45.480
Don't be scared.

36:56.880 --> 36:57.920
Duanwu!

36:59.040 --> 37:00.800
Shrimp. Shrimp.

37:50.520 --> 37:52.400
Duanwu!

38:11.880 --> 38:12.880
Shrimp.

38:16.680 --> 38:17.840
Shrimp.

38:20.960 --> 38:21.960
Shrimp.

38:22.920 --> 38:24.040
Shrimp.

39:03.040 --> 39:04.080
Master!

39:05.680 --> 39:07.120
Take the master away!

39:45.240 --> 39:49.040
I hope you're well when we meet again.

40:09.080 --> 40:09.960
Mr. Zhang.

40:11.440 --> 40:12.480
Eat something.

40:13.640 --> 40:14.880
Don't worry about it too much.

40:15.480 --> 40:17.000
At current marching speed,

40:17.080 --> 40:18.680
we can get to the Piti Spring
on the agreed date.

40:35.040 --> 40:36.120
Stay alive.

40:37.240 --> 40:38.080
Yan Zijing.

40:39.760 --> 40:40.760
We…

40:41.600 --> 40:45.280
must live.

40:50.800 --> 40:52.080
Kang Ju.

40:54.320 --> 40:55.440
Kang Ju.

41:04.160 --> 41:05.200
Eat it.

41:07.000 --> 41:08.320
Stay alive.

41:08.400 --> 41:09.680
We must live!

42:53.120 --> 42:55.720
-Kang Ju!
-Leader, the sandstorm is coming.

42:58.440 --> 42:59.880
They will surely die!

42:59.960 --> 43:00.960
Retreat!
